comments.body:
@mtothearkus I've seen similar, but for me it is caused by communication lost with the DanaRS pump at the end of the temp target time. When this happens,  the temp target remains 'stuck', as in your screen shot, until communication with the pump is successful. 

I had to restart the phone last time this happened. 

![Screenshot_20201025-223333_AndroidAPS](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15063589/97121208-69fe7280-1714-11eb-9a14-a9afdf295e18.jpg)
